7ec30a\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-advanced-heading wp-block-themeisle-blocks-advanced-heading-ce7ec30a\">Telebanca</h2>\n<!-- /wp:themeisle-blocks/advanced-heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|nv-site-bg\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"nv-site-bg\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-nv-site-bg-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Puede utilizarse desde cualquier teléfono, privado o público y permite el pago de más de una factura, con cargo a la tarjeta magnética del que lo solicita si el saldo disponible lo permite. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|nv-site-bg\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"nv-site-bg\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-nv-site-bg-color has-text-color has-link-color\">El <strong>servicio automático</strong>&nbsp;de <strong>voz interactiva</strong>, está activo  las <strong>24 horas</strong>,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\",\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":[]}} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px;width:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/button-group {\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-button-group-95351c8e\",\"align\":\"center\",\"paddingTopBottom\":15,\"paddingLeftRight\":50,\"fontSize\":16,\"fontFamily\":\"Montserrat\",\"fontVariant\":\"regular\",\"textTransform\":\"none\",\"fontStyle\":\"normal\"} -->\n<div id=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-button-group-95351c8e\" class=\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-button-group wp-block-buttons align-center\"><!-- wp:themeisle-blocks/button {\"id\":\"wp-block-themeisle-blocks-button-b91a0c77\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\",\"background\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dnv-primary-accent)\",\"border\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dnv-primary-accent)\",\"hoverColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dnv-site-bg)\",\"hoverBackground\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dnv-primary-accent)\",\"hoverBorder\":\"var(\\u002d\\u